---
layout: base
permalink: /about/
eleventyNavigation:
  key: About
---

<div class="container">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>My name is {{ meta.author }}. I like books, computers and science.</p>

    <p>I publish most of my code on
    <a href="https://github.com/umcconnell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>

    <p>
        You can reach out to me through my e-mail address:
        <img
            src="{{ '/assets/images/email.png' | url }}"
            alt="My e-mail address"
            style="height: 1.1rem"
        />
    </p>

    <h2 class="u-mt2">Research</h2>

    <p>
        I am an MSc student in Data Science at
        <a href="https://ethz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ETH Zürich</a>,
        where I also completed my BSc in Computer Science. My research
        interests are algorithm design and AI for bioinformatics.
    </p>

    <p>
        You can also find me on
        <a href="{{ meta.social_media.google_scholar }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar</a>
        and
        <a href="{{ meta.social_media.orcid }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ORCID</a>.
        My full CV is available
        <a href="{{ '/assets/other/CV_Ulysse_McConnell.pdf' | url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>.
    </p>

    {% msg "success", true, "🎓 Looking for a PhD or research position" %}
    <p>
        I am currently looking for a PhD or research position at the intersection of AI and bioinformatics, or related
        areas of computer science. Feel free to get in touch via e-mail!
    </p>
    {% endmsg %}

    <h3 class="u-mt2">Publications</h3>

    <ol class="cv-list" reversed>
        {% for pub in publications %}
        <li class="cv-item">
            <span class="cv-item__date">{{ pub.year }}</span>
            <div>
                <span class="cv-item__title">{{ pub.title }}</span>
                <span class="pub__authors">
                    {%- for author in pub.authors -%}
                    {% if author == meta.author %}<span class="pub__me">{{ author }}</span>{% else %}{{ author }}{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                </span>
                <span class="pub__venue">{{ pub.venue }}</span>
                {% if pub.note or pub.links | length %}
                <span class="pub__links">
                    {% if pub.note %}<span class="pub__badge">{{ pub.note }}</span>{% endif %}
                    {% for link in pub.links %}
                    <a class="pub__badge" href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ link.label }}</a>
                    {% endfor %}
                </span>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>

    <h3 class="u-mt1 u-mb1">PGP Key</h3>

    You can download my PGP key
    <a href="{{ '/assets/other/umcconnell.asc' | url }}" download>here</a> or
    copy-paste it from below.

    <pre
        class="frame u-text-select-all"
    ><code>{% include "src/assets/other/umcconnell.asc" %}</code></pre>

